//! The `animation-timing-function` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property
//! sets how an animation progresses through the duration of each cycle.
//!
//! Initial: ease. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: <easing-function>#
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-animations-1/#propdef-animation-timing-function
//!
//! Author guide:
